#: helpers/help.ts
msgid "Point at one tabular file; the descriptor is built around it as a single resource"
msgstr "Вкажіть один табличний файл; дескриптор будується навколо нього як єдиного ресурсу"

#: helpers/help.ts
msgid "Point at the file you received and paste the checksum that was published alongside it"
